# TEST FILE: the scenes of the test battles of Act 1's battle rules
# (ticket 0319): the defeated lines of the boss who retreats
# (battles/test_retreat.ron) and of the one who can't be killed
# (battles/test_hold.ron), and the hold's closing scene
# (chapters/test_hold.ron), in which the knight dies (`@dies`) if still in
# the army; if the knight already died, the lead stands there alone.

@scene test_rogue_retreats
@right test_rogue angry
test_rogue: Not here. Not today.
@end

@scene test_rogue_down
@right test_rogue sad
test_rogue: Down... but not done.
@end

@scene test_hold_won
@left  lead neutral
@if test_knight
@right test_knight neutral
test_knight: Go, {lead}. I'll hold the line.
@dies test_knight
@right clear
@else
> {lead} holds the line alone, and remembers who should be here.
@endif
@end
